# The Maven Wrapper jar is committed on purpose, mirroring the exception already made
# for gradle-wrapper.jar above. Without it, every CI run and every Docker build has to
# fetch it from wrapperUrl first, and a failed or partial download surfaces as
# "Could not find or load main class org.apache.maven.wrapper.MavenWrapperMain" — which
# is exactly what took CI down on main. This negation must stay below the *.jar rule.
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
